{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>生活裡的筆記、開支與文件往往散落在不同程式，翻找起來相當費時。Evthi 把筆記、財務記錄、文件掃描、提醒與專案整合於同一介面，所有資料只留在手機並以 AES-256 加密，適合重視私隱、希望離線整理生活紀錄的使用者。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-84.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>快速記錄自動分類整理</h2>\n<p>開啟後直接輸入即可，「groceries 25」自動記為支出，「tomorrow 3pm dentist」化成提醒，確認後一鍵儲存。筆記支援標題、清單、表格與圖片，可加入語音並以相機掃描紙本文字。財務方面可分類收支、設定預算及追蹤訂閱；文件掃描自動裁邊，連內文也可搜尋，並在到期前提醒。資料全程以 AES-256 加密留在手機，無需帳號。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-320-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-321-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-322-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-323-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-324-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-325-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Evthi: Notes, Money &amp; Docs</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/evthi-notes-money-docs/id6819098305?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:29.170585+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":383,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T22:04:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T21:38:25.023732+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:03.705196+00:00","content_hash":"3435d42a295d3733f5689cf4bb82e078fb999d7383617e31ac404d87e8ad01ef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}